      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems as though this (in combination with the changes to prebuiltLibraryHeaderFactory and NewPrebuiltLibrary() that causes noSrcsProperty to be set to true) is the crucial part of this change.\n\nCould the same effect not be achieved simply by changing the prebuiltLibraryHeaderFactory and NewPrebuiltLibrary() to provided a non-nil PrebuiltSrcsSupplier that throws an exception when called? That would cause srcsSupplier to be non-nil at this point so it will behave just as this would when noSrcsProperty \u003d true.\n\nThat should simplify this change by avoiding any changes to the prebuilt code.",
      "revId": "5c33ef170eaaa979dd8c8f95089132280af19b6e",
