      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, the crucial part of this change is that srcsSupplier is nil on line 404 below, and so doesn\u0027t get caught in the early return. I\u0027d have to introduce a 2nd return value from it to tell the cases apart, and then I think this is better since it\u0027s not a characteristic that needs to be decided on a per-call basis.",
