      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree about the subtle difference. This latest patch is better.\n\nI don\u0027t understand why you would need to compare function pointers. Just provide a dummy PrebuiltSrcsSupplier that returns a non empty array. e.g.\n\nsrcsSupplier :\u003d func(ctx android.BaseModuleContext, _ android.Module) []string {\n    return []string{\"this is an invalid path that should never be used\"}\n}",
      "parentUuid": "bab2ee03_fb7290ac",
